window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>I didn't need the cherry red stilettos and tight mini skirt to make an impression, but I'm a firm believer in going big or going home. Plus, those shoes cost me a small fortune, so why not flaunt them?</p> <p>The last thing I'd have expected was that the one man I could hardly bear to share the same breathing space with would find me and my shoes appealing enough to break his firm stand on not getting down and dirty with a colleague.</p> <p>Had I been wearing panties that night, we'd have never fallen down that rabbit hole. Regardless, we needed the release and believed it would be a one time deal — an unspoken truth.</p> <p>Note to self regarding unspoken truths: The heart never lies.</p>"; 
